{"id": "EUVD-2026-71944", "enisaUuid": "1c66dd0c-0ad6-3871-854a-c491c008ea82", "description": "BookWyrm through 0.9.1 fails to validate user visibility permissions in the Favorite and Unfavorite views, allowing authenticated attackers to favorite or unfavorite followers-only and direct statuses they cannot access. Attackers can POST to the favorite endpoint with a status ID to create unauthorized interactions, trigger ActivityPub broadcasts, and enumerate private status IDs through response differentiation.", "datePublished": "2026-09-05T09:59:04", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T14:20:59", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/geo-chen/oss/blob/main/bookwyrm.md#finding-2-authenticated-idor-in-favoriteunfavorite-allows-interaction-with-private-statuses", "https://github.com/bookwyrm-social/bookwyrm/blob/v0.9.1/bookwyrm/views/interaction.py", "https://github.com/bookwyrm-social/bookwyrm", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/bookwyrm-through-0.9.1-missing-authorization-on-the-favorite-and-unfavorite-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-86112", "GHSA-6779-9x55-mqpq"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.3, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6706d2cb-9754-373d-a9e4-02fffebc19c6", "product": {"name": "bookwyrm", "vendor": {"name": "bookwyrm-social"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.9.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "67684e89-3a84-3f68-ac4a-57d26d7c9be4", "vendor": {"name": "bookwyrm-social"}}], "isExploited": false}